; Ceiling bottom is y=60 (the ceiling body sits at y=40 with a 40 px shape),
; so a 48 px hazard centred at y=84 hangs flush beneath it and leaves about
; 190 px of headroom over the ground at y=300 -- enough for a compact swing
; to pass under, not enough for the wide flat arc the hazard exists to deny.
